    },
    "body": "Part of the effort discussed in #35994: replace procedural, field-by-field construction of `COutPoint`, `CTxIn` and `CTxOut` in test code with constructor calls.\r\n\r\nThis change is test-only, and has no behaviour change. Any change to the constructed transactions would be caught by the hash and signature checks in `script_tests` and `transaction_tests`.\r\n\r\n*Notes for reviewers: In `BuildSpendingTransaction`, the `scriptWitness` assignment is deliberately moved after `vin` is replaced, since `CTxIn` has no witness constructor argument.*",
