        "payload": "tree b5f775f905b7fa1c8befae7fdf2a3dd27f777eab\nparent 9878e2a5cf397ef10dd67a3605f4764d892b4976\nauthor Alexander Wiederin <alex@wiederin.xyz> 1792666711 +0200\ncommitter Alexander Wiederin <alex@wiederin.xyz> 1792666711 +0200\n\ntest: construct transaction_utils inputs/outputs declaratively\n\nReplace resize() followed by per-field assignments to COutPoint, CTxIn\nand CTxOut with constructor calls in an initializer list.\n\nIn BuildSpendingTransaction, the scriptWitness assignment moves after\nvin is replaced, since CTxIn has no witness constructor argument and\nassigning it first would discard it.\n\nNo behavior change.\n",
