      "body": "I am mostly thinking that 50 pulls/commits for this won't scale/review. My preference would be to just handle the trivial bulk of the changes with a trivial scripted-diff (that is, excluding the transformations that have lines in-between).\r\n\r\nThen, the tedious transformations can be done manually later, hopefully being a small amount of line changes.\r\n\r\nHappy to create an alternative pull to show it.",
